{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01KhSCgzTDveudruRwSAb7oV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VCq8fUh9TiyGFXesj6LzUy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\tuinalogy-services\\_reference\\tcm-terminology-index.md","content":"# TCM Bilingual Terminology Index — Tuinalogy Services\n\n**WIM Project:** MP-031-3:2016 推拿疗法服务 (Tuinalogy / Tuina Therapy Services)\n**Index Version:** 1.0 (2026-04-17)\n**Coverage:** C01–C05, E01–E02\n**Total Terms:** 110\n\n> This index is the **single source of truth** for all TCM terminology used across Tuinalogy WIM documents.\n> Run `python tools/validate-terminology.py` to check consistency.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Meridians (经络系统 / Sistem Meridian)\n\n| Chinese | English | Malay | NOSS Reference | Frequency |\n|---------|---------|-------|----------------|-----------|\n| 经络 | Meridian System | Sistem Meridian | C01/KP-02 | High |\n| 督脉 | Governor Vessel (Du Mai) | Meridian Kawalan (Du) | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 任脉 | Conception Vessel (Ren Mai) | Meridian Konsepsi (Ren) | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 冲脉 | Penetrating Vessel (Chong Mai) | Meridian Penetrasi (Chong) | E02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 带脉 | Belt Vessel (Dai Mai) | Meridian Tali Pinggang (Dai) | E02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 足太阳膀胱经 | Bladder Meridian (Foot Taiyang) | Meridian Pundi Kencing | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 足阳明胃经 | Stomach Meridian (Foot Yangming) | Meridian Perut | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 足少阳胆经 | Gallbladder Meridian (Foot Shaoyang) | Meridian Pundi Hempedu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 足太阴脾经 | Spleen Meridian (Foot Taiyin) | Meridian Limpa | C01/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 足少阴肾经 | Kidney Meridian (Foot Shaoyin) | Meridian Buah Pinggang | C01/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 足厥阴肝经 | Liver Meridian (Foot Jueyin) | Meridian Hati | C01/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 手太阳小肠经 | Small Intestine Meridian (Hand Taiyang) | Meridian Usus Kecil | C01/KP-02 | Low |\n| 手阳明大肠经 | Large Intestine Meridian (Hand Yangming) 