| C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 印堂 | Yintang (GV-29) | Titik Yin Tang | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 大椎 | Dazhui (GV-14) | Titik Da Zhui | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 天柱 | Tianzhu (BL-10) | Titik Tian Zhu | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 肩井 | Jianjing (GB-21) | Titik Jian Jing | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 肩髃 | Jianyu (LI-15) | Titik Jian Yu | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 肩髎 | Jianliao (TB-14) | Titik Jian Liao | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 肩贞 | Jianzhen (SI-9) | Titik Jian Zhen | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 肩中俞 | Jianzhongshu (SI-15) | Titik Jian Zhong Shu | C04/KP-02 | Low |\n| 天宗 | Tianzong (SI-11) | Titik Tian Zong | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 臂臑 | Binao (LI-14) | Titik Bi Nao | C04/KP-02 | Low |\n| 曲池 | Quchi (LI-11) | Titik Qu Chi | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 合谷 | Hegu (LI-4) | Titik He Gu | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 内关 | Neiguan (PC-6) | Titik Nei Guan | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 外关 | Waiguan (TB-5) | Titik Wai Guan | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 心俞 | Xinshu (BL-15) | Titik Xin Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 肺俞 | Feishu (BL-13) | Titik Fei Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 肝俞 | Ganshu (BL-18) | Titik Gan Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 脾俞 | Pishu (BL-20) | Titik Pi Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 肾俞 | Shenshu (BL-23) | Titik Shen Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 命门 | Mingmen (GV-4) | Titik Ming Men | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 足三里 | Zusanli (ST-36) | Titik Zu San Li | C02/KP-01 | High |\n| 阳陵泉 | Yanglingquan (GB-34) | Titik Yang Ling Quan | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 三阴交 | Sanyinjiao (SP-6) | Titik San Yin Jiao | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 涌泉 | Yongquan (KD-1) | Titik Yong Quan | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 膻中 | Shanzhong (CV-17) | Titik Shan Zhong | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 中脘 | Zhongwan (CV-12) | Titik Zhong Wan | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 天枢 | Tianshu (ST-25) | Titik Tian Shu | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 气海 | Qihai (CV-6) | Titik Qi Hai | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n| 关元 | Guanyuan (CV-4) | Titik Guan Yuan | C02/KP-01 | Medium |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Techniques (推拿手法 / Teknik Tuina)\n\n| Chinese | English | Malay | NOSS Reference | Frequency |\n|---------|---------|-------|----------------|-----------|\n| 八大手法 | Eight Major Tuina Techniques | Lapan Teknik Tuina Utama | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 推法 | Pushing Technique | Teknik Tolak | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 拿法 | Grasping Technique | Teknik Genggam | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 按法 | Pressing Technique | Teknik Tekan | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 捏法 | Pinching Technique | Teknik Cubit | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 揉法 | Kneading Technique | Teknik Uli | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 捻法 | Twisting Technique | Teknik Pulas | C02/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 摩法 | Rubbing Technique | Teknik Gosok | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 拍法 | Patting Technique | Teknik Tepuk | C02/KP-02 | High |\n| 擦法 | Scrubbing Technique | Teknik Gesek | C03/KP-01 | High |\n| 滚法 | Rolling Technique | Teknik Guling | C02/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 弹拨法 | Plucking Technique | Teknik Cungkil | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 㨰法 | Gun Rolling Technique | Teknik Guling Gun | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 抖法 | Shaking Technique | Teknik Gegar | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 搓法 | Friction Rubbing Technique | Teknik Geseran | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 扳法 | Manipulation Technique | Teknik Manipulasi | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n| 点按 | Point Pressing | Tekan Titik | C04/KP-02 | High |\n| 拔伸 | Traction Technique | Teknik Tarikan | C04/KP-02 | Medium |\n\n---\n\n## 6. Safety (安全与禁忌 / Keselamatan dan Kontraindikasi)\n\n| Chinese | English | Malay | NOSS Reference | Frequency |\n|---------|---------|-------|----------------|-----------|\n| 禁忌症 | Contraindications | Kontraindikasi | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 适应症 | Indications | Indikasi | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 注意事项 | Precautions | Langkah Berjaga-jaga | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 转介 | Referral | Rujukan | C01/KP-03 | High |\n| 知情同意 | Informed Consent | Persetujuan Termaklum | C01/KP-02 | High |\n| 职业操守 | Professional Ethics | Etika Profesional | C01/KP-03 | Medium |\n| 紧急情况 | Emergency Situation | Situasi Kecemasan | C01/KP-03 | Medium |\n| 堕胎穴 | Abortifacient Acupoints | Titik Akupresur Bahaya Kehamilan | C01/KP-03 | Medium |\n\n---\n\n*Index compiled from NOSS CoCU documents and WIM KP/KK/PM/PA/KA files.*\n*Generated: 2026-04-17*\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
